    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d381-a4">

                <pb facs="0829" n="819" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg819"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 4 in No. 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Consul Moore to Mr.
                        Benjamin.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Richmond,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 6, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge your
                    communication of yesterday’s date, transmitting to me the letters patent of the
                    president, revoking my exequatur as her Britannic Majesty’s consul for the State
                    of Virginia.</p>
                <p>Without communicating upon this act, I simply acknowledge its reception, which I
                    will communicate to my government by the first opportunity.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GEO. MOORE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
